{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Conveyor Belt Sushi Simulator&quot; is a cozy first-person simulation where you serve sushi to customers, earn money, and grow your sushi restaurant business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/fc84d1c3fcb8097f197a85af7178c210.avif?t=1773676538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras_big/fc84d1c3fcb8097f197a85af7178c210.avif?t=1773676538 width=800 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/3545d13bbf0142519474bfd3faa6ac80.poster.avif?t=1773676538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/3545d13bbf0142519474bfd3faa6ac80.webm?t=1773676538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/3545d13bbf0142519474bfd3faa6ac80.mp4?t=1773676538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own conveyor belt and serve customers promptly to ensure a smooth dining experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/36c72e77da5f2186780a6fd249fe039a.avif?t=1773676538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras_big/36c72e77da5f2186780a6fd249fe039a.avif?t=1773676538 width=800 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/18450919977f2a2ad81cc8c10fec0564.poster.avif?t=1773676538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/18450919977f2a2ad81cc8c10fec0564.webm?t=1773676538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/18450919977f2a2ad81cc8c10fec0564.mp4?t=1773676538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sushi and place it on the conveyor belt, allowing customers to pick their favorite sushi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/0b4c261667383094adc6ff50bed474f7.avif?t=1773676538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras_big/0b4c261667383094adc6ff50bed474f7.avif?t=1773676538 width=800 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/3a13e0f401f2ac565da221f6352e4b1a.poster.avif?t=1773676538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/3a13e0f401f2ac565da221f6352e4b1a.webm?t=1773676538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536670/extras/3a13e0f401f2ac565da221f6352e4b1a.mp4?t=1773676538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order stock from the supplier using your tablet. Seafood prices vary daily based on the day's supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.